Notes:
- Plan mode launches read-only agents only.
- Completion arrives as a notification. While a child runs, stay out of its scope; after it reports, check only a finding you will act on, and a writer's changes by diff. Steer only to correct a running child's direction. Controls: status (fleet or transcript), interrupt, stop, steer.{{/* completion_delivery: re-reading a child's files after its report, and steering finished children, were the measured waste; the notification is the one retrieval path */}}
